<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct refinery operating rate 70.5 pct - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct refinery operating rate 70.5 pct - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The utilisation rate of Japanese oil refineries was 70.5 percent in October, down from 74.4 percent in the same month last year and down from 77 percent in September, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Crude throughput amounted to 18.4 million kilolitres in October, down 4.8 percent from a year earlier and down 5.3 percent from September, MITI said.</p>
<p>Japan's oil companies currently have a combined refining capacity of 5.3 million barrels-per-stream-day.</p>
</text>
